Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: sharp,ls010b7dh04: Add LS013B7DH01

The LS013B7DH01 is the 144x168 Sharp Memory LCD the LS013B7DH05 is a
thinner revision of. It is obsolete, but still found in products, such
as Pebble watches.

The two are electrically the same, taking the same SPI commands and
VCOM signal at the same resolution, so the LS013B7DH05 compatible can
serve as a fallback and the sharp-memory driver drives the LS013B7DH01
unchanged.

This patch was prepared with the help of an AI coding assistant (Claude
Code, using Claude Opus 5.5), which wrote the change and this commit
message under the submitter's direction. It was reviewed by the
submitter, who takes responsibility for it.
